Begin Exploring Related Columns
Relevant columns & how they will be used  

• date : restrict the daily tables and build calendar months (YYYY‑MM).  
• hits (REPEATED) : we have to UNNEST it to reach every hit inside a session.  
  – hits.eCommerceAction.action_type :  
    2 = product‑detail view (denominator)  
    3 = add‑to‑cart (numerator #1)  
    6 = purchase / completed transaction (numerator #2)  
  – hits.product.isImpression : filter‐out list‑view impressions  
    Condition: WHERE (   ARRAY_LENGTH(h.product)=0  
                    OR  NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM UNNEST(h.product) p
                                     WHERE p.isImpression = TRUE) )  
  – hits.time (optional): general exploration, not needed for final metric.  

• _TABLE_SUFFIX (pseudo‑column when a wildcard table is used) : pick only the daily tables that belong to 2017‑01, 2017‑02, 2017‑03.  
  Example: WHERE _TABLE_SUFFIX BETWEEN '20170101' AND '20170331'  

─────────────────────────────────────────
Exploratory → incremental → final result  
(Every query is capped with LIMIT 20.)

```sql
--Description: 1) Peek at a few hits from 27‑Jan‑2017 to see the action_type codes.
SELECT
  date,
  fullVisitorId,
  h.hitNumber,
  h.eCommerceAction.action_type AS act
FROM `bigquery-public-data.google_analytics_sample.ga_sessions_20170127`,
     UNNEST(hits) AS h
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
--Description: 2) Show the distinct action_type codes found on 27‑Jan‑2017.
SELECT DISTINCT
  h.eCommerceAction.action_type AS action_type
FROM `bigquery-public-data.google_analytics_sample.ga_sessions_20170127`,
     UNNEST(hits) AS h
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
--Description: 3) Distinct action_type codes across all January‑2017 tables.
SELECT DISTINCT
  h.eCommerceAction.action_type
FROM `bigquery-public-data.google_analytics_sample.ga_sessions_*`,
     UNNEST(hits) AS h
WHERE _TABLE_SUFFIX BETWEEN '20170101' AND '20170131'
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
--Description: 4) Daily count of product‑detail pageviews (action_type = 2) for 27‑Jan‑2017.
SELECT
  date,
  COUNT(1) AS detail_views
FROM `bigquery-public-data.google_analytics_sample.ga_sessions_20170127`,
     UNNEST(hits) AS h
WHERE h.eCommerceAction.action_type = '2'
  AND ( ARRAY_LENGTH(h.product)=0
        OR NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM UNNEST(h.product) p WHERE p.isImpression = TRUE) )
GROUP BY date
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
--Description: 5) Daily add‑to‑cart hits (action_type = 3) for 27‑Jan‑2017.
SELECT
  date,
  COUNT(1) AS add_to_cart_hits
FROM `bigquery-public-data.google_analytics_sample.ga_sessions_20170127`,
     UNNEST(hits) AS h
WHERE h.eCommerceAction.action_type = '3'
GROUP BY date
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
--Description: 6) Daily purchases (action_type = 6) for 27‑Jan‑2017.
SELECT
  date,
  COUNT(1) AS purchase_hits
FROM `bigquery-public-data.google_analytics_sample.ga_sessions_20170127`,
     UNNEST(hits) AS h
WHERE h.eCommerceAction.action_type = '6'
GROUP BY date
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
--Description: 7) Monthly product‑detail pageviews for Jan‑2017.
SELECT
  '2017-01' AS month,
  COUNT(1)           AS detail_views
FROM `bigquery-public-data.google_analytics_sample.ga_sessions_*`,
     UNNEST(hits) AS h
WHERE _TABLE_SUFFIX BETWEEN '20170101' AND '20170131'
  AND h.eCommerceAction.action_type = '2'
  AND ( ARRAY_LENGTH(h.product)=0
        OR NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM UNNEST(h.product) p WHERE p.isImpression = TRUE) )
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
--Description: 8) Monthly add‑to‑cart & purchase counts for Feb‑2017.
SELECT
  '2017-02'                            AS month,
  COUNTIF(h.eCommerceAction.action_type = '3') AS add_to_cart_hits,
  COUNTIF(h.eCommerceAction.action_type = '6') AS purchase_hits
FROM `bigquery-public-data.google_analytics_sample.ga_sessions_*`,
     UNNEST(hits) AS h
WHERE _TABLE_SUFFIX BETWEEN '20170201' AND '20170228'
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
--Description: 9) Roll‑up counts for ALL three months (Jan–Mar‑2017) in one pass.
SELECT
  FORMAT_DATE('%Y-%m', PARSE_DATE('%Y%m%d', _TABLE_SUFFIX)) AS month,
  COUNTIF(h.eCommerceAction.action_type = '2'
          AND ( ARRAY_LENGTH(h.product)=0
                OR NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM UNNEST(h.product) p
                                WHERE p.isImpression = TRUE) ) ) AS detail_views,
  COUNTIF(h.eCommerceAction.action_type = '3') AS add_to_cart_hits,
  COUNTIF(h.eCommerceAction.action_type = '6') AS purchase_hits
FROM `bigquery-public-data.google_analytics_sample.ga_sessions_*`,
     UNNEST(hits) AS h
WHERE _TABLE_SUFFIX BETWEEN '20170101' AND '20170331'
GROUP BY month
ORDER BY month
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
--Description: 10) FINAL ANSWER – monthly add‑to‑cart and purchase conversion
--              rates (percentage of product‑detail pageviews) for Jan‑Mar‑2017.
SELECT
  month,
  detail_views,
  add_to_cart_hits,
  purchase_hits,
  ROUND(100 * add_to_cart_hits / detail_views, 2) AS add_to_cart_rate_pct,
  ROUND(100 * purchase_hits    / detail_views, 2) AS purchase_rate_pct
FROM (
  SELECT
    FORMAT_DATE('%Y-%m', PARSE_DATE('%Y%m%d', _TABLE_SUFFIX)) AS month,
    COUNTIF(h.eCommerceAction.action_type = '2'
            AND ( ARRAY_LENGTH(h.product)=0
                  OR NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM UNNEST(h.product) p
                                  WHERE p.isImpression = TRUE) ) ) AS detail_views,
    COUNTIF(h.eCommerceAction.action_type = '3') AS add_to_cart_hits,
    COUNTIF(h.eCommerceAction.action_type = '6') AS purchase_hits
  FROM `bigquery-public-data.google_analytics_sample.ga_sessions_*`,
       UNNEST(hits) AS h
  WHERE _TABLE_SUFFIX BETWEEN '20170101' AND '20170331'
  GROUP BY month
)
ORDER BY month
LIMIT 20;
```

